NOTES
- Page root: every section AND every modal element carries the class `lm-mpd`
  (the page-root scope) in addition to its own wrapper class. The master.css is
  scoped under `.lm-mpd`, so this class must be present on each Custom HTML
  element for styles to apply.
- Tabs: sections 3–8 are the "Current Program" tab; sections 9–11 are the
  "All Programs" tab. Their root element carries `data-tabgroup="current"` or
  `data-tabgroup="all"`. The program-tabs JS (section 2) shows/hides by that
  attribute. Sections 1–2 and 12–14 are always visible.
- Modals/popups live in each section's `popups/` folder and are pasted as
  additional Custom HTML elements (page-level is fine). Triggers stay in the
  owning section; each popup has its own JS.

